        " اَلْفَضَاءِ فَقَالَ «لاَ بَأْسَ وَ إِنْ سُتِرَ بِسِتْرٍ فَهُوَ أَحَبُّ إِلَيَّ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.397 - Ali ibn Ja'far asked his brother Imam Musa ibn Jafar Al-Kadhim (as) about washing the deceased in an open space.\nImam (as) replied: \"There is no issue with it, but if they are covered with a curtain (for privacy), that is more beloved to me.\""
        ]
      }
